    narr:narration """This position holds the settled cadence for recurring reaction summaries: [the per-run bundle stays and a weekly roll-up is added on Fridays](narr:Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_2), restated verbatim two days later as [team policy](narr:Expr_20260927_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_hf65a0248bea8_2). The scope line runs through [Tanya's clarification that the bundle is for the run and the roll-up is for the week](narr:Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_4), echoed in the later record ([same ruling](narr:Expr_20260927_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_hf65a0248bea8_4)). A rejected alternative is on the graph: [the daily digest was turned down because it would repeat the bundle word for word](narr:Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_5), with the rejection rationale recorded again in the later pass ([rejection re-recorded](narr:Expr_20260927_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_hf65a0248bea8_5)). Tina's scope question was relayed both times ([asked whether the roll-up replaces the bundle](narr:Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_3); [the same question relayed again](narr:Expr_20260927_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_hf65a0248bea8_3)). The phrasing carries the hub's style-lane signature — antithesis and parallelism in the org lane.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_2> ;
